OL,6,     FBrooklyn to Montauk: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo heads east from Manhattan
OL,8,     Fto Brooklyn, and takes the Long
OL,9,     FIsland Railroad to Queens.
OL,10,G0300 Great American Railroad Journeys
OL,11,     FNew York City to Albany: Michael
OL,12,     FPortillo follows America's iconic
OL,13,     FRiver Hudson, beginning at New
OL,14,     FYork City's Penn Station, before
OL,15,     Fsampling ale and meeting the State
OL,16,     FSenator in Albany.
